{"title":"Virikh Templar","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 53 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 5 times (2.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>52</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>73</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>6</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=52\" title=\"Pick level 52\"><td><b>52</b></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td>52</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=53\" title=\"Pick level 53\"><td><b>53</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>73</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=54\" title=\"Pick level 54\"><td><b>54</b></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>7</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>6</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/f2cf6d115aa44596472c.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/7f94933bcea154fb0661.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/8c92c1a7459808b1c464.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/0daa3638c429dd9245f9.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/a5194048a7e028e118ed.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Ice)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/11bb300274d693